\b
\q1
\v 5 The¦32559 deep waters cover¦32557 them¦32557.
\q1 ≈They¦32558 descended into the¦32559 depths¦32559 like¦32560 a stone¦32562.
\q1
\v 6 Yahweh's right¦32564 arm is so powerful¦32567.
\q1 ≈Yahweh's right arm shattered¦32570 our enemy¦32571.
\q1
\v 7 You toss away your adversaries¦32576 with¦32573 your great¦32573 power.
\q1 Your¦32576 burning¦32578 anger¦32578 consumes¦32579 them¦32579 like¦32580 straw \add in a fire\add*.
\q1
\v 8 It was your breath¦32582 that made the waters¦32585 pile up¦32584.
\q1 They¦32586 stood¦32586 up like¦32587 a heap¦32589.
