\v 16 Terror¦32674 and¦32675 dread¦32675 have¦32691 fallen¦32672 on¦32676 them¦32673.
\q1 \add After seeing\add* your¦32683 great¦32676 power, they've stayed as still¦32678 as stone¦32679
\q2 until¦32680 your people¦32683 have all marched past, Yahweh¦32684.
