\q1
\v 17 Bring¦32693 them¦32693 into \add the land\add*
\q2 and¦32694 establish¦32703 them on¦32695 the mountain¦32695 of your inheritance¦32696.
\q1 The place¦32697 you've¦32699 chosen to¦32698 become your home, Yahweh¦32700—
\q2 a sanctuary¦32701 built by your hands¦32704, master¦32702.
