\v 15 Then¦33846 Mosheh¦33847 built¦33846 an¦33848 altar¦33848 and¦33846 he¦33849 named it¦33849 ‘Yahweh-nissi’ \add (which means ‘Yahweh is my banner’)\add*,
\v 16 saying¦33855, “Because¦33856 \add ≈they battled\add* against Yah's¦33864 throne¦33861, then¦33855 Yahweh¦33862 \add ≈will battle¦33863\add* against Amalek¦33865 \add ≈throughout the¦33861 generations¦33867\add*.”
