\p
\v 1 \add Now\add* Yetro (Jethro), the priest¦33872 at Midian¦33873 and Mosheh's¦33875 father-in-law¦33874, heard about everything that God¦33881 had done¦33880 for Mosheh and for his¦33884 people¦33884 the Israelis—that Yahweh¦33888 had brought¦33887 \add #the Israelis\add* out¦33887 of Egypt¦33892.
