\v 4 “You yourselves saw¦34432 what I did¦34434 to the Egyptians—how I carried¦34436 you on¦34438 eagles' wings¦34440 and¦34442 brought¦34442 you all \add here\add* to myself¦34444.
\v 5 And¦34453 now¦34446, if¦34447 you all carefully¦34449 listen to¦34451 my \add ≈words\add* and¦34446 keep¦34452 my agreement¦34455, then¦34446 \add ≈your nation\add* will¦34456 be¦34456 my possession¦34458, \add separate\add* from¦34459 all the \add others\add*, because¦34462 all the earth¦34467 is mine,\x + \xo 19:5-6: \xt 1Pe 2:9.\x*
\v 6 \add So\add* you¦34480 all will¦34470 be¦34470 my kingdom¦34473 of priests¦34474 and¦34475 a nation¦34475 \add dedicated to me\add*.” (That's the message¦34478 to pass on to the Israelis¦34484.)\x + \xo 19:6: \xt Rev 1:6; 5:10.\x*
\v 7 \add So\add* Mosheh¦34487 descended \add again\add* and¦34486 summoned the Israeli¦34493 elders¦34489, then¦34486 he passed on that¦34498 message¦34496 \add just\add* as Yahweh¦34500 had¦34499 commanded¦34499 him¦34499,
\v 8 and¦34502 all¦34503 the people responded¦34507 together¦34506, \add agreeing\add*, “We'll do¦34513 everything that¦34509 Yahweh has¦34511 said¦34507.” Then¦34502 Mosheh¦34515 took the people's¦34519 response back to¦34520 Yahweh
\v 9 and¦34524 Yahweh told¦34545 \add *him\add*, “Look, I'll come¦34531 to you in¦34533 a thick cloud¦34534 so that the people¦34537 will be able to hear¦34536 when¦34538 I speak¦34538 with¦34533 you \add so they'll also continue to\add* trust¦34543 you.”
