\p
\v 16 \add So\add* on the morning¦34669 of the third¦34667 day¦34666, there was¦34670 thunder¦34671 and lightning¦34672 and a thick cloud¦34673 on the mountain¦34677, and an extremely loud horn¦34679 blast, and all¦34683 the people¦34685 in¦34666 the camp¦34687 were trembling¦34682.\x + \xo 19:16: \xt Rev 4:5.\x*
