\v 5 Yahweh¦41735 \add had\add*\f + \fr 33:5 \ft Assumed.\f* \add ≈told\add* Mosheh¦41738, “Tell the¦41742 Israelis¦41744, ‘You're all \add ≈stubborn\add* people. If I went¦41753 with¦41754 you for \add even\add* one¦41752 moment¦41751, then I'd destroy¦41755 you. \add ≈So¦41734\add* now, take¦41757 off your¦41754 \add ≈jewellery and anything fancy that¦41760 you're wearing\add*, and then I'll know what¦41761 I'll do¦41762 to¦41764 you.’ ”
\v 6 \add ≈So¦41766\add* from Mt. Sinai \add onwards\add*, the Israelis¦41769 stripped¦41766 themselves¦41766 of their¦41772 \add ≈jewellery and¦41766 fancy things\add*.
\s1 The tent for meeting God
